{"4599180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pantheon", "steam_appid": 4599180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is currently only available in Simplified Chinese. Other language store assets are for visual reference only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>前情提要：</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《神祇》是一部以“个人成长和社会批判”为主题的视觉小说。请谨慎阅读。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >简介：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不被世人理解的暗物质之神 &amp; 平平无奇的失业少女</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在繁华大都市里，有这样一个平凡的女大学生。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >大学毕业后的你，生活四处碰壁。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >工作被辞、论文被骂、房租被催，同时还要被家人吸血！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这个世界，究竟想要人怎样？什么时候，活着也成了一种罪过？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >可就在你崩溃欲绝的时候，一道蓝光出现了。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >河中的人影，究竟是谁？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >为何祂的姿态，如此不同？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >救我的目的，又当意欲何为？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >难道真的是我，命不该绝！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >都市玄幻女性向视觉小说《神祇Pantheon》，双向救赎，光与暗的宿命，由此启程。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ 关于Demo存档：本游戏的Demo版本与正式版存档不兼容。正式版无法继承Demo的存档进度，敬请谅解。</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is currently only available in Simplified Chinese. Other language store assets are for visual reference only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>前情提要：</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《神祇》是一部以“个人成长和社会批判”为主题的视觉小说。请谨慎阅读。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >简介：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不被世人理解的暗物质之神 &amp; 平平无奇的失业少女</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在繁华大都市里，有这样一个平凡的女大学生。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >大学毕业后的你，生活四处碰壁。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >工作被辞、论文被骂、房租被催，同时还要被家人吸血！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这个世